Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteenth Episode\NThe Castle of Roses\NMansion of Roses
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bored already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything fun to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, it is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The closing ceremony is set for 10 o'clock! Why are you dawdling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time, Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it time for the ceremony...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, Your Highness, where are you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I go is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive my intrusion, but please do not go to the southern valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The southern valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is quite dangerous, with frequent rockslides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s headed for the southern valley, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The southern valley, huh... Dangerous with frequent rockslides sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could have thrown this away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a rockslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That Grand Duke Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The outer castle in the southern valley also remains unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The camouflage curtain is peeling right off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.81,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, good thing they didn't find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers are as lovely as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Opal, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an old ruin! What a letdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Master Sapphire, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right—Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall meet again, Master Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell me your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange perfume scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come from the Mansion of Roses to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mansion of Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's that strange perfume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading toward the south valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there always a place like this in the southern valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Rose Mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rose perfume!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire,...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,please head to the white rose boat on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Master Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So it really was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Duke Blanc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Blanc?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you call for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How many thousands of years has it been since our ancestors first settled in this corner of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We take pride in being born here and in dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But lately, someone has been trying to drive us from this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only live in this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Blanc, who on earth is trying to drive you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll help! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is Prince Sapphire going to be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Rouge, how insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my brother's rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sick and tired of this weed-infested land!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just hand it over to Grand Duke Duralumin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, you shameless fool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to betray me and our comrades?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Say whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just get other land in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a magnificent land fit for a king, without a single weed in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this! You're brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd best stay out of this for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of your secret, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Exploiting someone's secret is cowardly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my brother knows the Prince's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We brothers have a knack for seeing right through people's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do the two of you claim to know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother or not, I cannot forgive your cowardly ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumambagio!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange night that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please protect our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a magnificent fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the cliffside artillery is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,crushing the neighboring kingdom will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And that neighboring kingdom will belong to you, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the curtain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the Grand Duke out of sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.41,0:14:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ruined if we're found out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Prince Sapphire, we are merely investigating a rockslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a sign of a rockslide anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, what on earth are you up to here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Your Highness, I assure you we are doing nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, I heard from Duke Blanc, the lord of this region,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were planning to tear down Rose Mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rose Mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Blanc?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know nothing of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where is this Rose Mansion supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing in the southern valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have been dreaming last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it on top of the cliff, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That went well, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The me are working above.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,, You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We are constructing a gun battery, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A gun battery?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That Duralumin... He intends to start a war with our neighbor on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow you to trample flowers just to prepare for war!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt the construction!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do whatever you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you care more about flowers than war?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear this sham down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin did this to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I can't believe they're just drenching people with water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Water is the greatest feast of all for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Water is a feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... was this all because of the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because of the flowers blooming in the southern valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Spirit of the White Rose,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and my companions are the Spirits of the Weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Water is the finest feast for us. We took the form of humans
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and a mansion only because we wanted to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day, tens of thousands of our brethren are trampled by Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:18:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All for his ugly desire for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you wanted to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Blanc, gather your friends! Let's defeat Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I must ask you not to meddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What good comes from helping such wretched weeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We red roses shall move to Duralumin's estate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and live peacefully in a sunny garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tended to every day by master gardeners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you care nothing for your brethren, Rouge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less what happens to those filthy weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.85,0:19:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumanbachi! Sting Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire, hurry, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for the Kumanbachi monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Kumanbachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this man has been saying something rather strange about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims he will testify before everyone that you are actually a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, it comes at a price. What are your terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not have much longer to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to grow this in your garden, so that our kind may flourish once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.33,0:22:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant this in my garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.83,0:22:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make a fool out of Grand Duke Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.89,0:22:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Grand Duke Duralumin—cousin to the King of Silverland and Chief of Police!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think such pitiful flowers would ever be planted in his garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.93,0:22:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Our vital witness has vanished...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,about this fortress...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.69,0:22:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The fortress was built because it was necessary to defend the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was out of patriotism! —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall speak to my father and obtain permission to tear it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This Kingdom of Silverland has no need for patriotism that builds fortresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.23,0:23:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Blanc! You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. What happened to my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heart, Duke Blanc.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to demolish that fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your companions can live in the southern valley forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers and grass of the southern valley will never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! So you were a spirit after all!
